WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.780
One small world.

00:02.480 --> 00:08.762
From here the storms, the currents, the ice and the forests are one thin skin on one small world.

00:09.212 --> 00:12.196
Nothing we know of anywhere else has all of them.

00:12.646 --> 00:19.260
The Moon, four hundred thousand kilometres off, is the farthest any person has ever been from it.
